From 6d2f3bbc4336affe8e5bf7940b2f9cb8cf9f04f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Li Wei <liwei825@huawei.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Feb 2023 16:52:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 325/921] [Huawei] ocfs2: add customized modifications for
 resize

Offering: HULK
ocfs2 inclusion
category: feature
bugzilla: NA

----------------------------------------

Add customized modifications for resize.

Signed-off-by: Li Wei <liwei825@huawei.com>
---
